# ART-ALL11 -- W3-FIX-A acceptance: ALL11 (TEMPERATE, island assault). The
# map's Naval Yards (GAYARD x1, NAYARD x2, WaterBound) stand on the water, and
# the SHP units -- Terror Drones, Dolphins, Giant Squid -- exist as map units
# (4 DLPH, 4 SQD placed) and TaskForce members.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL11T.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
assert img.DLPH >= 4
assert img.SQD >= 4
cheat view_building GAYARD
wait 2
shot gayard
cheat view_building NAYARD
wait 2
shot nayard
cheat view_unit DLPH
wait 2
shot dolphins
cheat view_unit SQD
wait 2
shot squid
# (the Giant Squid is Underwater+Cloakable: submerged and unseen, as the original)
